Source of /usr/local/bin/prlimit and libsmartcols
=================================================

prlimit and libsmartcols.so.1 are unpacked unchanged from Debian 12 (bookworm)'s binary packages
util-linux and libsmartcols1, version 2.38.1-5+deb12u3, as published on
https://snapshot.debian.org at 2024-12-09T14:44:08Z. Their source is the Debian source package
util-linux 2.38.1-5+deb12u3:

  https://snapshot.debian.org/package/util-linux/2.38.1-5%2Bdeb12u3/

